## Why This Is Asked
Tests DNS propagation, basic network troubleshooting, and edge-case cache issues in a multi-site setup.

## Key Concepts
- DNS TTL propagation
- Local resolvers and caches
- Basic reachability tools: curl, traceroute, dig
- Edge firewall/NAT impact on DNS/IP traffic

## Code Example
```javascript
// Node.js snippet to run a dig command and print results
const { exec } = require('child_process');
exec('dig +trace api.example.com', (err, stdout, stderr) => {
  if (err) { console.error(err); return; }
  console.log(stdout);
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you verify TTL propagation across multiple resolvers?
- How would you safely roll DNS changes with minimal downtime?
